&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;section&lt;/code&gt;: Content resources. Must be a section. Path can be an absolute path (with &lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt; prefix, relative to base URL), or relative path (without &lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt;, relative to current path)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>